      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. can you dive a bit deeper into the actual cellular mechanics of that mTORC1 activation? i'm interested in the specific role of Rag GTPases in sensing those leucine levels and bringing the mTOR to the lysosomal membrane. how does that interaction actually initiate the signaling cascade?",
